</p>


<br>


<p>

    Every poem begins with a thought.
    Every verse carries an emotion.
    Every poem tells a story.

</p>

</div>

</section>

</div>



<!-- =========================
     POEM READER
========================= -->

<div id="reader" class="page">

<section class="section">

<div class="reader">


<div
    id="readerLanguage"
    class="reader-language">

</div>


<h1 id="readerTitle">
</h1>


<div
    id="readerDate"
    class="reader-date">

</div>


<div
    id="readerPoem"
    class="reader-poem">

</div>


<br><br>


<button
    class="btn btn-secondary"
